\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {19}{\ignorespaces \textbf  {Mechanism-matched oracle ablations (fine-tuned models).} Each intervention supplies gold information for one reasoning stage; a metric is \emph  {targeted} if it depends on that stage. The gold conflict label moves Behaviour Adherence and nothing else; the gold per-document notes move every grounding and citation metric in $9/9$ cells and leave the answer/refusal decision untouched. $p$ is an exact two-sided sign test over model$\times $prompt cells. Qwen2.5-32B is excluded from the conflict-oracle columns because of the scoring artifact documented in Appendix~\ref {app:artifacts}; the $+/n$ column reports the exact number of cells contributing to each test ($n=9$ for the conflict oracle, $n=12$ otherwise).}}{31}{table.19}\protected@file@percent }
